 that's just what Merowlink is counting on, since one of the bandits is his next quarry. But the train has an important passenger who may turn out to be an even bigger prize.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fJGpp9VesIBa8ydIVvdRgvardP4.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"A railway headed through an isolated mountain pass makes a tasty target for bandits. And that's just what Merowlink is counting on, since one of the bandits is his next quarry. But the train has an important passenger who may turn out to be an even bigger prize.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fJGpp9VesIBa8ydIVvdRgvardP4.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1161","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"2048","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"2048","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44631","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"114771","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"98731","synopsis":"Having survived the bandit attack, Merowlink now learns that General Helmetione is Lulusy's uncle, and that she has her own grudges against him. The two of them flee to an abandoned city, and soon must face an elite special forces unit led by Major Boyle, formerly of the Planbandol battalion. This may be a fight that Merowlink isn't prepared to win.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xMrm0kSJgbWq0tr77krHCAn6BLh.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Having survived the bandit attack, Merowlink now learns that General Helmetione is Lulusy's uncle, and that she has her own grudges against him. The two of them flee to an abandoned city, and soon must face an elite special forces unit led by Major Boyle, formerly of the Planbandol battalion. This may be a fight tha